{
  "name": "Higgsfield → YouTube Shorts Auto-Publisher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup checklist\n1. **Anthropic credential** (`anthropicApi`) — API key for script/metadata generation.\n2. **Higgsfield API credential** (`httpHeaderAuth`) — header name `Authorization`, value `Key <KEY_ID>:<KEY_SECRET>`. Verified against the official `higgsfield-ai/higgsfield-js` SDK source: base URL `https://platform.higgsfield.ai`, auth header format `Authorization: Key {apiKey}:{apiSecret}`.\n3. **YouTube OAuth2 credential** (`youTubeOAuth2Api`) scoped to `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/youtube.upload`, for channel https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC110FLC_x-RTU45CKTyWI1g.\n4. **SMTP credential** on the two Email Send nodes (or swap for Slack/Telegram).\n5. **Google Sheets credential + spreadsheet** on \"Log Published Short\" (or remove that node).\n\nHiggsfield has no single text-to-video call — its actual pipeline (confirmed from SDK source) is two jobs: **text-to-image** (`flux-pro/kontext/max/text-to-image`), then **image-to-video** (`/v1/image2video/dop`, the \"DoP\" camera-motion model) using the generated image as input. Both jobs are polled the same way: `GET /requests/{request_id}/status`.\n\nUpload defaults to `privacyStatus: private` so you can review a Short before making it public.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-360, -320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "days", "daysInterval": 1, "triggerAtHour": 9, "triggerAtMinute": 0 }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Daily Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-140, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "anthropicApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
            { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-5-20250929\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 1024,\n  \"system\": \"You are a short-form video scriptwriter. Reply with ONLY a JSON object (no prose, no markdown fences) matching this schema: {\\\"title\\\": string (<=90 chars, must include #Shorts), \\\"description\\\": string, \\\"tags\\\": string (comma separated keywords), \\\"script\\\": string (15-40 words of spoken narration), \\\"visual_prompt\\\": string (a vivid single still-image scene description for an AI image generator, vertical 9:16 framing), \\\"camera_motion\\\": string (a short camera-movement direction for animating that still image, e.g. 'slow dolly in, subtle parallax')}.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Generate a new, original YouTube Shorts concept (facts, motivation, storytelling, etc). Avoid repeating common cliches.\" }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-generate-script",
      "name": "Generate Script & Metadata (Claude)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [100, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json;\nconst text = raw.content?.[0]?.text;\nif (!text) {\n  throw new Error('Anthropic response had no text content: ' + JSON.stringify(raw));\n}\n\nconst match = text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(match ? match[0] : text);\n} catch (error) {\n  throw new Error(`Could not parse script JSON from Claude response: ${error.message}`);\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: parsed }];"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-script",
      "name": "Parse Script JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [340, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://platform.higgsfield.ai/flux-pro/kontext/max/text-to-image",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ input: { prompt: $json.visual_prompt, aspect_ratio: \"9:16\", safety_tolerance: 2 } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-create-image-job",
      "name": "Create Higgsfield Image Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [580, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Endpoint + body shape verified against higgsfield-ai/higgsfield-js README example."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const job = $input.first().json;\nif (!job.request_id) {\n  throw new Error('Higgsfield image job response had no request_id: ' + JSON.stringify(job));\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { request_id: job.request_id, started_at: Date.now() } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-init-image-poll",
      "name": "Init Image Poll State",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [820, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "amount": 10, "unit": "seconds" },
      "id": "wait-image-poll",
      "name": "Wait Before Image Poll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1060, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ \"https://platform.higgsfield.ai/requests/\" + $('Init Image Poll State').item.json.request_id + \"/status\" }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-check-image-status",
      "name": "Check Higgsfield Image Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1300, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.first().json;\nconst startedAt = $('Init Image Poll State').item.json.started_at;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    status: res.status,\n    image_url: res.images?.[0]?.url ?? null,\n    elapsed_ms: Date.now() - startedAt,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-evaluate-image-status",
      "name": "Evaluate Image Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1540, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "img-cond-completed",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "completed",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Completed"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "img-cond-failed",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "failed",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "img-cond-nsfw",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "nsfw",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "img-cond-canceled",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "canceled",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "img-cond-timeout",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.elapsed_ms }}",
                    "rightValue": 300000,
                    "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt", "name": "filter.operator.gt" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Failed or Timed Out"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "extra" }
      },
      "id": "switch-route-image-status",
      "name": "Route Image Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1780, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://platform.higgsfield.ai/v1/image2video/dop",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ input: { model: \"dop-turbo\", prompt: $('Parse Script JSON').item.json.camera_motion, input_images: [{ type: \"image_url\", image_url: $json.image_url }] } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-create-video-job",
      "name": "Create Higgsfield Video Job (DoP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2020, -160],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Endpoint + body shape verified against higgsfield-ai/higgsfield-js README example for image-to-video (model dop-turbo)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const job = $input.first().json;\nif (!job.request_id) {\n  throw new Error('Higgsfield video job response had no request_id: ' + JSON.stringify(job));\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { request_id: job.request_id, started_at: Date.now() } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-init-video-poll",
      "name": "Init Video Poll State",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2260, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "amount": 15, "unit": "seconds" },
      "id": "wait-video-poll",
      "name": "Wait Before Video Poll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [2500, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ \"https://platform.higgsfield.ai/requests/\" + $('Init Video Poll State').item.json.request_id + \"/status\" }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-check-video-status",
      "name": "Check Higgsfield Video Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2740, -160],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.first().json;\nconst startedAt = $('Init Video Poll State').item.json.started_at;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    status: res.status,\n    video_url: res.video?.url ?? null,\n    elapsed_ms: Date.now() - startedAt,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-evaluate-video-status",
      "name": "Evaluate Video Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2980, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "vid-cond-completed",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "completed",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Completed"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "vid-cond-failed",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "failed",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "vid-cond-nsfw",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "nsfw",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "vid-cond-canceled",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "canceled",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals", "name": "filter.operator.equals" }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "vid-cond-timeout",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.elapsed_ms }}",
                    "rightValue": 600000,
                    "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt", "name": "filter.operator.gt" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Failed or Timed Out"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "extra" }
      },
      "id": "switch-route-video-status",
      "name": "Route Video Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [3220, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.video_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "file", "outputPropertyName": "data" } }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-download-video",
      "name": "Download Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [3460, -320],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "upload",
        "title": "={{ $('Parse Script JSON').item.json.title }}",
        "categoryId": "24",
        "binaryProperty": "data",
        "options": {
          "description": "={{ $('Parse Script JSON').item.json.description + \"\\n\\n#Shorts\" }}",
          "tags": "={{ $('Parse Script JSON').item.json.tags }}",
          "privacyStatus": "private",
          "notifySubscribers": true,
          "selfDeclaredMadeForKids": false
        }
      },
      "id": "youtube-upload",
      "name": "Upload Short to YouTube",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youTube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [3700, -320],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Confirm categoryId (24 = Entertainment) and privacyStatus for channel https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC110FLC_x-RTU45CKTyWI1g"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_NAME" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "videoId": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "title": "={{ $('Parse Script JSON').item.json.title }}",
            "url": "={{ \"https://youtu.be/\" + $json.id }}",
            "publishedAt": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-log",
      "name": "Log Published Short",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.6,
      "position": [3940, -420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "REPLACE_WITH_SENDER_EMAIL",
        "toEmail": "bchamp248@gmail.com",
        "subject": "✅ New YouTube Short published",
        "text": "={{ \"Published: \" + $('Parse Script JSON').item.json.title + \"\\nhttps://youtu.be/\" + $json.id }}"
      },
      "id": "email-success",
      "name": "Notify Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [4180, -420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    message: `Higgsfield/YouTube Shorts pipeline failed.\\nStatus: ${item.status ?? 'unknown'}\\nDetails: ${JSON.stringify(item)}`,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-format-failure",
      "name": "Format Failure Notice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2020, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "REPLACE_WITH_SENDER_EMAIL",
        "toEmail": "bchamp248@gmail.com",
        "subject": "⚠️ YouTube Shorts pipeline failed",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}"
      },
      "id": "email-failure",
      "name": "Notify Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [2260, 260]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily Trigger": { "main": [[{ "node": "Generate Script & Metadata (Claude)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Generate Script & Metadata (Claude)": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Parse Script JSON", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Script JSON": { "main": [[{ "node": "Create Higgsfield Image Job", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Create Higgsfield Image Job": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Init Image Poll State", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Init Image Poll State": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait Before Image Poll", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Wait Before Image Poll": { "main": [[{ "node": "Check Higgsfield Image Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Check Higgsfield Image Status": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Evaluate Image Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Evaluate Image Status": { "main": [[{ "node": "Route Image Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Route Image Status": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Create Higgsfield Video Job (DoP)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Wait Before Image Poll", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Create Higgsfield Video Job (DoP)": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Init Video Poll State", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Init Video Poll State": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait Before Video Poll", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Wait Before Video Poll": { "main": [[{ "node": "Check Higgsfield Video Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Check Higgsfield Video Status": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Evaluate Video Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Evaluate Video Status": { "main": [[{ "node": "Route Video Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Route Video Status": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Download Video", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Format Failure Notice", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
